sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Accountant
  participant UI
  participant API
  participant Reviewer
  Accountant->>UI: Request second opinion
  UI->>API: Authenticated owner request
  API->>Reviewer: Separate review contract and allowed evidence
  Reviewer->>Reviewer: Challenge assumptions and contradictions
  Reviewer->>API: Outcome, references, concerns, uncertainty, next action
  API->>Accountant: Review finding; no state mutation
  Accountant->>API: Separate explicit financial decision if desired
